{"id":1440,"date":"2026-04-16T12:44:06","date_gmt":"2026-04-16T12:44:06","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/?p=1440"},"modified":"2026-04-16T12:44:06","modified_gmt":"2026-04-16T12:44:06","slug":"jornadas-de-capacitacion","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/jornadas-de-capacitacion\/","title":{"rendered":"Jornadas de capacitaci\u00f3n"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/IMG-20260416-WA0000.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/IMG-20260416-WA0000-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1441\" srcset=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/IMG-20260416-WA0000-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/IMG-20260416-WA0000-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/IMG-20260416-WA0000-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/IMG-20260416-WA0000-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/IMG-20260416-WA0000.jpg 1599w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">En el marco de la Ordenanza Municipal N\u00ba7465\/2025, los d\u00edas 19, 20, 26, 27 y 31 de marzo, docentes del Instituto Superior Experimental en Tecnolog\u00eda de Alimentos (ISETA) dictaron en las instalaciones del Centro San Cayetano la CAPACITACION OBLIGATORIA EN MANIPULACION SEGURA DE ALIMENTOS PARA CARNICERIAS. La inscripci\u00f3n y coordinaci\u00f3n estuvo a cargo de la Direcci\u00f3n de Bromatolog\u00eda Municipal. Los docentes capacitadores fueron Miguel \u00c1ngel Blanco y Mar\u00eda Jos\u00e9 Santa Cruz.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Estas jornadas fueron destinadas a carniceros y personal de carnicer\u00edas con los que, durante los 5 encuentros, se trabajaron contenidos tanto en aspectos t\u00e9cnicos como pr\u00e1cticos, procurando una mejora en la calidad sanitaria de la carne y los productos que ellos comercializan garantizando la salud de los consumidores. En esta oportunidad nos acompa\u00f1aron 35 participantes que se mostraron muy comprometidos con alcanzar los objetivos propuestos en la Capacitaci\u00f3n exigida por la Municipalidad de 9 de Julio.&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>En el marco de la Ordenanza Municipal N\u00ba7465\/2025, los d\u00edas 19, 20, 26, 27 y 31 de marzo, docentes del &hellip; <\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-1440","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-sin-categoria"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1440","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1440"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1440\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1442,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1440\/revisions\/1442"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1440"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=1440"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\